  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.2.1 is a compatible stability patch for Windows x64/x86 and .NET 8. Fixes: serialize same-ref Release runs; x64/x86-selectable Hook/VMT and Injector diagnostics; classify unloadable DLL injection as LM_LoadModuleEx failure; recover final-candidate DataScan/PatternScan/SigScan results and reject address-range overflow; reject unsupported explicit NuGet PlatformTarget (AnyCPU or arm64) even when Platform is supported. No managed Public API, pinned native libmem, or package layout changes. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.2.1 是 Windows x64/x86 与 .NET 8 的兼容性稳定修复版本。修复：同一引用的 Release 任务串行执行；Hook/VMT 与 Injector 诊断支持选择 x64/x86；无法加载的 DLL 注入按 LM_LoadModuleEx 错误归类；修复 DataScan/PatternScan/SigScan 末尾合法候选遗漏并拒绝地址范围溢出；即使 Platform 有效，也拒绝显式设置 AnyCPU/arm64 等不支持的 PlatformTarget。Public API、固定 native libmem 版本和包布局保持不变。Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/docs/releases/v2.2.1.md",
